      "block_id": "p-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "1.  **VSCodium**: Extension host API (v1.90+ recommended). 2.  **Node.js**: For extension development. 3.  **Python 3.12+**: For the Rig Relay daemon.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-6",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Key Risks to Schedule",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "*   **Worktree Complexity**: Managing git state across multiple lanes without corrupting the user's main working copy is the highest technical risk. *   **VS Code API Stability**: Relying on proposed APIs (if needed) can break the extension on minor updates. *   **Mac OS Notarization**: If we pivot to Option B (Bundled App), signing will add weeks of friction.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
